mirrored  check-guard-wiring.py
ci-only   check-gui-protocol.sh  -- Regenerates apps/chaos-ui/src/generated/protocol.ts by building chaos-engine in the dev profile (`cargo run --bin chaos-protocol-schema`); the entry point's own cargo gates stop at check/clippy, and CI runs this in the job that has already built the engine.
ci-only   check-powershell-syntax.py  -- `--require` needs a real PowerShell to parse scripts/install.ps1; the verify image is Debian bookworm-slim, which has no pwsh in the pocket it installs from, and adding one means the Microsoft package feed. Running the installer is the target-OS leg's job either way.
